829165_1745429309770602_3173616434644146412_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q-8TsqO6FgoQ7kNvwFku9dV&_nc_oc=Adq3zmvZqyno8nXb8S8CQE5E_c9NnXY9Jtfrq7FXvIE-NOjyTLAHXbKDEhnTSrxwnzw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBIOuRZYJbnFMbAPpYY90u4_LGnXsNDqSGzP907WMU1Hg&oe=6A577E2F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_24bit.png", "id": "779451085235427", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820887_779451088568760_4820113829668856600_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tFjc_mh3MNsQ7kNvwECEWrC&_nc_oc=AdoF7_pXub8pxO09tLBIHOKFLgjGNTTVBywCBfpfrmhQ4o9QjQwGY6fXVI4qCyxwEZg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBaffP5nfFD8k_HIyuNE3nEVbrPFbKPJ1GsrT3IkczqlA&oe=6A579A71"}, "display_name": "weelio DEMO", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is Weelio (DEMO), a VR experience designed around the thrill of speed. You dodge, strafe, and shoot obstacles along the way. This is a game for everybody, regardless of your VR experience: intuitive controls and no acceleration to avoid discomfort.\n\nAs you traverse the track, you strafe left and right to avoid obstacles and shoot at hostile drones. Manage your health, grab power-ups, and get to the finish line.\n\nWishlist the full game at https://www.meta.com/experiences/27240704588852632\n\nFor suggestions & bug reports head over to https://weeliovr.github.io/game/\n", "short_description": "This is Weelio (DEMO), a VR experience designed around the thrill of speed. You dodge, strafe, and shoot obstacles along the way. This is a game for everybody, regardless of your VR experience: intuitive controls and no acceleration to avoid discomfort.\n\nAs you traverse the track, you strafe left and right to avoid obstacles and shoot at hostile drones. Manage your health, grab power-ups, and get to the finish line."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/wee